// Kiro specific strings that live in the Code OSS core.
//
// Kiro is a fork and compiled its own UI into the workbench: the session shell and
// Settings panel (vs/workbench/contrib/kiroStandalone/*), the spec and steering
// toolbars, supervised diff review, the license editor, the welcome carousel. These
// keys therefore belong to the `vscode` translation id, not to kiro.kiroAgent, and
// microsoft/vscode-loc has no translation for any of them.
//
// Rules: keep {0} placeholders, $(codicon) markers, (command:...) links and && menu
// mnemonics exactly as they are. Run `npm run gap` to see what is still missing.
